# Trained AI Models Directory

This directory will contain the exported neural network models after training.

Expected files after training:

- easy-ai.json (Generation 30)
- medium-ai.json (Generation 80)
- hard-ai.json (Generation 200)
- nightmare-ai.json (Generation 500)

These files are loaded by the game's AI controller to power AI opponents.
Each file is approximately 5KB in size.
